   [
    "pages",
    0,
    "text"
   ],
   "$(thing)Upgrades/$ are craftable items which can be inserted into machines and some tools to enhance their functionality in some way. To add upgrades to tools, you will need a $(l:machines/charging_station)Charging Station/$.$(p)The precise effect of each upgrade varies by device; it's documented in the machine's GUI, or (for items) in the Charging Station's upgrade GUI.",
   "$(thing)升级/$是可合成的物品，可以插入机器和部分工具中，以某种方式增强其功能。要为工具添加升级，你需要一个$(l:machines/charging_station)充气站/$。$(p)每种升级的具体效果会因设备而异；相关说明可在机器的 GUI 中查看，而物品则可在充气站的升级 GUI 中查看。"
